# FAQ Updates and New Dedicated FAQ Page

The goal is to update the existing contact page FAQ with new content and create a dedicated FAQ page that showcases a more creative and premium visual approach.

## Proposed Changes

### [MODIFY] [FAQ.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/contact/FAQ.tsx)
- Replace the current FAQs with the 5 new questions and answers provided by the user.
- Keep the design sober and integrated with the contact page's flow.

### [NEW] [DetailedFAQ.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/faq/DetailedFAQ.tsx)
- Create a premium display for the same 5 questions.
- **Design Strategy**:
    - Use **metallic-glass cards** in a grid or staggered layout.
    - Add relevant icons for each question (e.g., `Award` for certifications, `Clock` for time, `Search` for audits).
    - Implement the "light sweep" effect on hover.
    - Focus on high-end typography and clear hierarchy.

### [NEW] [FAQHero.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/faq/FAQHero.tsx)
- A standard hero section matching [AboutHero](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/about/AboutHero.tsx#1-17) and [ServicesHero](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/services/ServicesHero.tsx#5-21) for consistency.

### [NEW] [page.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/app/faq/page.tsx)
- Assemble the `FAQHero`, `DetailedFAQ`, and [CTA](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/sections/CTA.tsx#5-28).

### [MODIFY] [Footer.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/ui/Footer.tsx)
- Add "Preguntas Frecuentes" to the quick links.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to ensure no broken links or missing components.

### Manual Verification
- Visual inspection of the updated Contact FAQ.
- Exploration of the new dedicated FAQ page to ensure "creative freedom" aligns with the premium brand identity.
